    "evidence_text": "List of American Pie characters\n\n Only one character, Noah Levenstein played by Eugene Levy, has appeared in all eight released films.\n\nJohn Cho\n\n Early in his career he also starred in the Asian-American films \"Better Luck Tomorrow\", \"Shopping for Fangs\", and \"Yellow\".\n\nChris Owen (actor)\nChris Owen (born September 25, 1980) is an American actor and photographer.\n He is best known for his role as The Sherminator in the \"American Pie film franchise\", appearing in \"American Pie\", \"American Pie 2\", \"\" and \"American Reunion\".\n Aside from Eugene Levy, he is the only actor from the theatrical features to appear in the \"\"American Pie Presents:\"\" direct-to-video spin-off movies.\n\nHole in One (2010 film)\n\n Now, he has to earn money through golf for the reverse surgery.\n\n It is awaiting a US Domestic release.\n\n No other figures reported.\n\nEugene Levy\n\n He is the only actor to have appeared in all eight of the \"American Pie\" films, in his role as Noah Levenstein.\n\nSugar (Tonic album)\n\nTara Reid\n\nArmed and Dangerous (1986 film)\n\nShannon Elizabeth\n\n She became widely known as a sex symbol for her role in the 1999 comedy film \"American Pie\".\n\nChris Weitz\n\n He is the brother of filmmaker Paul Weitz.",
